        <p>
          Four LCA catalogs are downloaded to local storage at startup — HiQLCD 1.4, Ecoinvent 3.12, CarbonMinds 2.0, Agri-footprint 7.0 — and kept current via verified sync. Catalog search runs locally against the downloaded files. No network call is made for a catalog query. Once downloaded, catalogs work offline.
        </p>
        <p>
          The <strong style="font-weight: 500;">out-of-workspace gate</strong> runs on every file write and shell command. Any operation whose path falls outside the project folder is intercepted before it executes: the user sees the specific path, a one-sentence reason, and three options — Allow once / Always allow this directory / Deny. The gate fires regardless of session mode. The agent cannot bypass it.
        </p>
        <p>
